---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Book Mattress Cleaning in Omaha | Call, Text or Schedule Online" description="Book an Omaha mattress cleaning: call or text (402) 512-5658, or schedule online with Sleep Sanitation. Hours, service area and what to have ready." path="/book">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <span class="eyebrow">Book or contact</span>
      <h1>Book an Omaha appointment</h1>
      <p>There are two ways to book. Both reach the same local crew.</p>
      <h2>1. Call or text</h2>
      <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="tel:+14025125658">Call (402) 512-5658</a> &nbsp; <a class="btn" href="sms:+14025125658">Text (402) 512-5658</a></p>
      <p>Hours: Monday–Friday, 9am–6pm. Missed a call? We return calls and texts on Saturday and Sunday too.</p>
      <h2>2. Schedule online</h2>
      <p>Online booking runs on Sleep Sanitation's scheduler, because Omaha Mattress Cleaning is a division of Sleep Sanitation. The link below opens that page on sleepsanitation.com.</p>
      <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://sleepsanitation.com/schedule" rel="noopener">Schedule online with Sleep Sanitation</a></p>
      <h2>Service area</h2>
      <p>Omaha, Elkhorn, Papillion, La Vista, Bellevue, Gretna, Ralston, Chalco, Bennington, Waterloo, Valley and Council Bluffs. Not sure about your address? Call or text and we'll confirm.</p>
      <h2>Helpful to have ready</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The mattress brand and model, and a photo of the care label if you can.</li>
        <li>How many beds, and their sizes.</li>
        <li>Any accident, odor or stain we should know about, and roughly when it happened.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Email works too: <a href="mailto:info@sleepsanitation.com">info@sleepsanitation.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
